-*   **Inputs:** Tetrahedral mesh (vertices, connectivity), scalar field values (stored per vertex or in a Tetrahedral Texture), gradient vectors (precomputed per vertex), transfer function (TF), camera parameters (view, projection matrices) [S2, S3].
-*   **Outputs:** Final color and opacity image.
